        "quote": "(b) The effective times of day for each school zone shall be established by the Traffic Operations Division in conjunction with the school authorities of the affected schools. The Traffic Operations Division shall maintain a public record of the established effective times for each school zone.",
        "ref_id": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:10.20.160:block:1#text",
