          "source_component_key": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:10.20.160:block:2",
          "start": 508
        },
        "quote": "(c) It is permissible for the effective times of day and durations of school zones servicing any public or private elementary or middle school to vary from the effective times and durations of any or all other school zones within the City, as deemed necessary by the Transportation Operations Division. The fact that the effective times and durations of a school zone vary from others within the City shall not constitute a defense to a traffic charge of exceeding that posted school zone speed limit. (Ord. 17815 § 4, 4-9-02; Ord. 17190 § 2, 10-21-97. Code 1981 § 43-327. Code 1995 § 142-214.)",
